# Third-party content that is not ours to redistribute.
#
# FB4 cue thumbnails are extracted from Pangolin's FB4 Beam Content Pack PDF.
# Anyone with an FB4 has the pack and can regenerate them locally:
#   node --experimental-strip-types scripts/generateFb4CueCatalog.ts
# The cue catalogue works without them; it simply shows no preview image.
runtime/public/fb4-thumbnails/*.png
runtime/public/fb4-thumbnails/*.svg

# Rendered scene footage. Large, regenerable with `npm run render:scene-demo`,
# and quickly stale whenever the scenes change.
runtime/rendered-demos/
